			"id": "SchoolAdviesDetail",
			"route": "/admissions/schooladviezen/:id",
			"type": "detail",
			"title": "School advies",
			"config": {
				"register": "learniq",
				"schema": "school-advies",
				"_note": "po-schooladvies-flow: a groep-8 schooladvies moves voorlopig -> definitief (guarded by SchoolAdviesFinalizeGuard's heroverweging rule) -> verzonden-naar-rod (auto-queues a bron-rod DataExchangeJob). lifecycleActions expose vaststellenDefinitief/verzendenNaarRod as buttons. Distinct from ApplicationDetail, which is the receiving VO school's own intake side.",
				"lifecycleActions": {
					"field": "lifecycle"
